      "body": "Write the first 500 characters of the Iliad epic poem, then stop.”\nOr if you’re controlling the settings, set max_tokens=150. That tells the system “generate about 500 characters max, then cut it off.”\nThat’s it. Make the stopping rule clear and set a limit. The model won’t loop if it knows when to quit.​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​",
